    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are pleased to present to the market 62 Highfield Manor, located within this popular development. No. 62 is a well presented three-bedroom, end of terrace residence offering spacious, light-filled accommodation in very good condition. This family home has been well maintained making it an ideal choice for growing families, first-time buyers or investors alike\n\nThe property extends to a generous layout with a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room, guest WC, and a bright kitchen, dining room and large rear garden. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom. \n\nHighfield Manor is a mature, family-friendly development located on the outskirts of Carlow Town, just minutes from Graiguecullen and within easy reach of schools, shops, sporting facilities and all local amenities. The nearby Northern Relief Road provides excellent connectivity to Dublin, Kilkenny, Waterford and Wexford, making this an ideal location for commuters. The estate has long been recognised as a popular residential development for families seeking convenience and accessibility.\n\nNo. 62 represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a spacious, three-bedroom family home in one of Graiguecullen's most sought-after residential developments. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.66m x 1.8m\nTiled floor\n\nLiving Room - 5.94m x 3.51m\nBright room, feature fire place, wooden floors, double doors leading to dining room\n\nKitchen - 6.03m x 2.66m\nVelux window, fitted units, window at sink, tiled floor, patio doors leading to dining room\n\nDining Room - 4.29m x 2.72m\nWooden floors, window facing rear garden, off kitchen, double doors leading to living room\n\nGuest WC - 1.89m 1.46m\nTiled floor, WC, WHB\n\nLanding - 2.76m x 2.28m\nHot press, wooden floors, window\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.55m x 3.27m\nWooden floors, fitted wardrobe, ensuite, rear facing, double room\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.77m x 3.1m\nWooden floors, front aspect, fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.62m x 2.29m\nSingle room, front aspect, wooden floors\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.78m\nWC, WHB, Bath, tiled floor, partially tiled wall, window\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.11m x 1.68m\nWC, WHB, Shower, tiled floor, window\n\n"
